        <detaileddescription>
<para>Delegates all the work to <computeroutput><ref refid="" kindref="compound">run(String[])</ref></computeroutput> and prints its result. Kept deliberately thin so that the parsing/calculation logic in <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> can be unit tested without touching the console.</para>
