    <briefdescription>
<para>This class represents the main application class for the Calculator App. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The CalculatorApp class provides the entry point for the Calculator App. It parses three command-line arguments (operand, operator, operand), computes the result with <computeroutput><ref refid="" kindref="compound">Calculator</ref></computeroutput> and prints it. It never reads from standard input, so it is safe to run from a non-interactive script and to unit test directly. <simplesect kind="author"><para>ugur.coruh </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
